{"title":"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_10B_Problems#Problem_6\" title=\"2021 AMC 10B Problems\">2021 AMC 10B #6</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems#Problem_4\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems\">2021 AMC 12B #4</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(One_Variable)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (One Variable)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Two_Variables)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Two Variables)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Ratio)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Ratio)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Convenient_Values)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Convenient Values)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5_(Basic_manipulation)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5 (Basic manipulation)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Punxsutawney_Phil\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Punxsutawney Phil</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Hawk_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Hawk Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_(Clever_Application_of_Average_Formula)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Clever Application of Average Formula)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Under_2_min!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Under 2 min!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Ms. Blackwell gives an exam to two classes. The mean of the scores of the students in the morning class is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/3/4131457f67c5dbfd8b1c6be1f74a47595a9bd3be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$84$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" />, and the afternoon class's mean score is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The ratio of the number of students in the morning class to the number of students in the afternoon class is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e1150a17bf1b733cb666be84d920c71fc96bb3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" />. What is the mean of the scores of all the students?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/9/a899d6dc5e1fa0f36cfcaf38d92e9a9458b5178f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} ~74 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)} ~75 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)} ~76 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)} ~77 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)} ~78$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28One_Variable.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(One_Variable)\">Solution 1 (One Variable)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (One Variable)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let there be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/e/70e634348f8df9eaeac4ced35db64d08a906532e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> students in the morning class and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4977828049d99f20ccd3b4acb6bbd43c2eb70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> students in the afternoon class. The total number of students is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/c/69c89df5e0c2f6cb861f40699c5475ff9d914dae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x + 4x = 7x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"104\" height=\"14\" />. The average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/5/fb599c4655ea253e7144eacfb3efef6c9ebb949b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3x\\cdot84 + 4x\\cdot70}{7x}=76$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"169\" height=\"37\" />. Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/6/066fa3f8ea202c1860de9398c3d08b7d0c3fc3ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)} ~76}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~ {TSun} ~\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Two_Variables.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Two_Variables)\">Solution 2 (Two Variables)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Two Variables)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose the morning class has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> students and the afternoon class has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> students. We have the following table:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/c/d8cfccc9e2bb5552c530ce9b1368e0f7f21acee0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{array}{c|c|c|c} &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ [-2.5ex] &amp; \\textbf{\\# of Students} &amp; \\textbf{Mean} &amp; \\textbf{Total} \\\\ \\hline &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ [-2.5ex] \\textbf{Morning} &amp; m &amp; 84 &amp; 84m \\\\ \\hline &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ [-2.5ex] \\textbf{Afternoon} &amp; a &amp; 70 &amp; 70a \\end{array}\\]\" width=\"359\" height=\"67\" />\nWe are also given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/b/80b28db69193a90a8f7e542c6bddecafbe063be3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac ma=\\frac34,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"61\" height=\"38\" /> which rearranges as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/a/4ba463bae50515da984e1effe3b094c9b33f040c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=\\frac34a.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"66\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>The mean of the scores of all the students is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/c/b1c4a3b5c094c6a9ed4c9ff7e9b5e886bba6b6de.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{84m+70a}{m+a}=\\frac{84\\left(\\frac34a\\right)+70a}{\\frac34a+a}=\\frac{133a}{\\frac74a}=133\\cdot\\frac47=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)} ~76}.\\]\" width=\"456\" height=\"48\" />\n~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Ratio.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Ratio)\">Solution 3 (Ratio)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Ratio)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Of the average, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/1/961ddbdcca282c1a0b4e662389363ba95c0e53c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{3+4}=\\frac{3}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"80\" height=\"39\" /> of the scores came from the morning class and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/1/e418cb8fb0c830e7ad6eb1e2c03056fd51d8c45e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> came from the afternoon class. The average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/d/d2d363609f226d8f4cd5302bd942dff65af5e557.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{7}\\cdot 84+\\frac{4}{7}\\cdot 70=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)} ~76}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"202\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>~Kinglogic\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Convenient_Values.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Convenient_Values)\">Solution 4 (Convenient Values)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Convenient Values)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>WLOG, assume there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> students in the morning class and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the afternoon class. Then the average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/1/c1101becbbd1eaa1f5763c609f77315632531ff5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3\\cdot 84 + 4\\cdot 70}{7}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)} ~76}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"198\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5_.28Basic_manipulation.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5_(Basic_manipulation)\">Solution 5 (Basic manipulation)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5 (Basic manipulation)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b10d5ee88ffc7d59f9c282b366953fb4fa4051f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> be the sum of the morning class's scores, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/4/7f4caea56d945d0b6e49701b42ce06e0fb92e663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> be the sum of the afternoon class's scores. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/e/70e634348f8df9eaeac4ced35db64d08a906532e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> be the number of students in the morning class, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/4/ed4977828049d99f20ccd3b4acb6bbd43c2eb70f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> be the number of students in the afternoon class. We can write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/0/8b081f09ed402f99961aa91bdf7aa1148abfd952.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{S_1}{3x}=84$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"68\" height=\"39\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/e/83eb471916e0fda205ab94e3aac3313e2c498e46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{S_2}{4x}=70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"68\" height=\"39\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/b/c6b53ad5c6be3c5e35eefa012cf19264d2fe3531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_2 = 70 \\cdot 4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/5/c05b348706539cc1d9fba9b8b359190241e496ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1 = 84 \\cdot 3x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" />. Adding these, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/a/dfa6d13b0323844caff4fad09715cc035082e1ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1 + S_2 = x(70 \\cdot 4 + 84 \\cdot 3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"213\" height=\"20\" />. We want to find the mean, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/6/356aaee258452dd5972f59854aeb5f2143098f43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{S_1+S_2}{7x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"65\" height=\"39\" />, so dividing by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d8dd5f375b5f3874868d24a8820fe854a68a28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> on both sides of the equation, we get the mean to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/e/0aeea256c36937de4258e130a3af0f3bf8c341c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 \\cdot 4 + 12 \\cdot 3 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)} ~76}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"198\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~vaishnav\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Punxsutawney_Phil\">Video Solution by Punxsutawney Phil</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Punxsutawney Phil\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtube.com/watch?v=qpvS2PVkI8A&amp;t=249s\">https://youtube.com/watch?v=qpvS2PVkI8A&amp;t=249s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Hawk_Math\">Video Solution by Hawk Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Hawk Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VzwxbsuSQ80\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VzwxbsuSQ80</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_.28Clever_Application_of_Average_Formula.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_(Clever_Application_of_Average_Formula)\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Clever Application of Average Formula)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Clever Application of Average Formula)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/lE8v7lXT8Go\">https://youtu.be/lE8v7lXT8Go</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/GYpAm8v1h-U\">https://youtu.be/GYpAm8v1h-U</a> (for AMC 10B)\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/EMzdnr1nZcE?t=608\">https://youtu.be/EMzdnr1nZcE?t=608</a> (for AMC 12B)\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Interstigation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/DvpN56Ob6Zw?t=426\">https://youtu.be/DvpN56Ob6Zw?t=426</a>\n</p><p>~Interstigation\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Under_2_min.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Under_2_min!)\">Video Solution (Under 2 min!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Under 2 min!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/EgBKBCOn9Mo\">https://youtu.be/EgBKBCOn9Mo</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B\">2021 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?